From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 09:28:42 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): turn WCS about its own axes

Right-compose quarter turns with the current setup orientation and name
the setup frame in the page. Pin all axes and both signs on an oblique WCS.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1495
